# Japanese: the text of the original Japanese release, akuji ver1.01,
# converted from Shift-JIS. The Yes/No prompt gains a leading space so
# the hand clears both words at 12 pixels, and the signs name the bound
# keys with {JUMP} and {FIRE}. See notes/divergences.md, DIV-026 and DIV-028.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Akuji the Demon\n"
"Language: ja\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"X-Akuji-Font: PixelMplus12-Regular.ttf\n"
"X-Akuji-Font-Size: 12\n"
"X-Akuji-Menu-Name: JP\n"

msgctxt "window.title"
msgid "Akuji the Demon"
msgstr "魔王のアクジ"

msgctxt "opening:0"
msgid "A demon named \"Akuji\" once  "
msgstr "　　ある国に魔王がいました。"

msgctxt "opening:1"
msgid "terrorized this land. "
msgstr "　　その名は【アクジ】"

msgctxt "opening:2"
msgid "Akuji's mischief brought  "
msgstr "　　【アクジ】は悪さをして"

msgctxt "opening:3"
msgid "misfortune upon the people. "
msgstr "　　人々を困らせていました。"

msgctxt "opening:4"
msgid "One day, a hero came to the   "
msgstr "　ある日、一人の【ゆうしゃ】が"

msgctxt "opening:5"
msgid "kingdom to slay Akuji."
msgstr "　この国を訪れました。"

msgctxt "opening:6"
msgid "After an amazing battle, the  "
msgstr "　激しい戦いの末【ゆうしゃ】は"

msgctxt "opening:7"
msgid "hero was victorious.          "
msgstr "　【アクジ】を打ち倒しました。"

msgctxt "opening:8"
msgid "The hero was praised and wed"
msgstr "【ゆうしゃ】は功績を称えられ"

msgctxt "opening:9"
msgid "the princess to become the king."
msgstr "お姫様と結婚して王になりました。"

msgctxt "opening:10"
msgid "But Akuji's powers were only    "
msgstr "　一方【アクジ】はその邪悪な力を"

msgctxt "opening:11"
msgid "sealed in nine stones."
msgstr "　９個の石に封印され…"

msgctxt "opening:12"
msgid "The stones were hidden in a "
msgstr "　　地下迷宮に閉じ込められて"

msgctxt "opening:13"
msgid "deep labyrinth.   "
msgstr "　　しまいました。"

msgctxt "opening:14"
msgid "    And now...      "
msgstr "　　　　　　そして…"

msgctxt "opening:16"
msgid "Akuji is recovering them"
msgstr "　力を失った【アクジ】は"

msgctxt "opening:17"
msgid "to seek revenge on the hero..."
msgstr "　【ゆうしゃ】に復讐する為に…"

msgctxt "opening:18"
msgid "In this underground labyrinth,"
msgstr "　この地下迷宮に封じられている"

msgctxt "opening:19"
msgid "the nine stones lie sealed.     "
msgstr "　９つの力を探しに行くのでした。"

msgctxt "ending:0"
msgid "    Light covered Akuji as"
msgstr "　　最後の封印「ソウル」に"

msgctxt "ending:1"
msgid "    he broke the last seal... "
msgstr "　　触れたアクジは光に包まれ…"

msgctxt "ending:2"
msgid " He's transforming back!"
msgstr "　　　　　真の姿が蘇る！"

msgctxt "ending:4"
msgid "What's going on?!?"
msgstr "　　　　　　　！？"

msgctxt "ending:6"
msgid "His horns are all that grew..!"
msgstr "　　ツノしか生えませんでした…"

msgctxt "ending:8"
msgid "  Akuji learned a lesson. "
msgstr "　　　　その後、アクジは…"

msgctxt "ending:10"
msgid "Disgusted, he decides to  "
msgstr "　　懲りもせず、悪さをして"

msgctxt "ending:11"
msgid "not cause mischief anymore. "
msgstr "　　人々を困らせましたとさ。"

msgctxt "powerup:0"
msgid "Fire    "
msgstr "ファイア"

msgctxt "powerup:1"
msgid "Fire+     "
msgstr "ファイア＋"

msgctxt "powerup:2"
msgid "Charge  "
msgstr "チャージ"

msgctxt "powerup:3"
msgid "Jump+     "
msgstr "ジャンプ＋"

msgctxt "powerup:4"
msgid "Dash    "
msgstr "ダッシュ"

msgctxt "powerup:5"
msgid "Jump++      "
msgstr "ジャンプ＋＋"

msgctxt "powerup:6"
msgid "Cloud   "
msgstr "クラウド"

msgctxt "powerup:7"
msgid "Bat   "
msgstr "バット"

msgctxt "powerup.found"
msgid "  %s was recovered! "
msgstr "【%s】を取り戻した！"

msgctxt "prompt.yesno"
msgid " Yes         No  "
msgstr " はい　　いいえ"

msgctxt "tk000:0"
msgid "aaaaaaaa"
msgstr "aaaaaaaa"

msgctxt "tk001:0"
msgid ""
"It's time to search for the nine\n"
"stones the hero sealed off! \\e"
msgstr ""
"【ゆうしゃ】に封じられた\n"
"【９つの力】を探しに行こう！\\e"

msgctxt "tk001:1"
msgid ""
"Those things are \"Mana Stones.\" \\kIf you gather enough of them, \n"
"your LIFE will increase!  \\e"
msgstr ""
"あれは【マナストーン】\\k集めれば最大ＬＩＦＥが\n"
"１つ増えるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk001:2"
msgid ""
"Press {LEFT} or {RIGHT} twice\n"
"to perform a Dash move.\\kYou should try it right away! \\e"
msgstr ""
"【{LEFT}か{RIGHT}キー】を\n"
"２回押すと【ダッシュ】出来るよ。\\kさっそく使ってみよう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk001:3"
msgid ""
"Those things are \"Mana Stones.\" \\kBut it seems they're already  \n"
"gone... \\e"
msgstr "あれは【マナストーン】\\kてか、もう無いけど…\\e"

msgctxt "tk001:4"
msgid ""
"Once you've achieved \"Rank S\" \n"
"you can come here.\\kAfter clearing the game, select \n"
"\"NEW GAME\" on the title screen\n"
"and head over here. \\e"
msgstr ""
"ランクＳを取ったら\n"
"来てみよう。\\kクリア後に\n"
"「ＮＥＷ　ＧＡＭＥ」で\n"
"開始すると開いてるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk002:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk002:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk002:2"
msgid ""
"Touching a Devil Statue can \n"
"save your game. \\kYou may want to save now since\n"
"it's going to get pretty\n"
"dangerous from here on out. \\e"
msgstr ""
"【魔王の像】に触れれば\n"
"【セーブ】する事が出来るよ。\\kこの先は危険なので\n"
"セーブしてから進もう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk003:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk003:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk003:2"
msgid ""
"Those green guys are Herohero.\\kYou won't be able to advance\n"
"until you find a way to beat\n"
"them... \\e"
msgstr ""
"緑のアイツは【ヘロヘロ】\\kどうにかして倒さないと\n"
"先へは進めないかも…\\e"

msgctxt "tk003:3"
msgid ""
"This fire can be used to shoot. \\kSometimes enemies may leave \n"
"behind items when you beat\n"
"them. \\e"
msgstr ""
"これで【ファイア】が撃てるよ。\\k敵を倒せば【回復アイテム】を\n"
"落としたりするよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk003:4"
msgid ""
"You can adjust your jump height \n"
"by how long you hold down the \n"
"{JUMP} key. \\e"
msgstr ""
"ジャンプは{JUMP}キーを離す事で\n"
"微調整出来るよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk004:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk004:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk004:2"
msgid ""
"You found Gallery Book #1!\\kAfter clearing the game, go to\n"
"OPTIONS to see the extra art! \\kThere's 7 volumes in all! \n"
"Keep on searching!\\e"
msgstr ""
"【ギャラリー本１】を発見！\\kゲームクリア後に\n"
"ＯＰＴＩＯＮ画面で\n"
"おまけ画像が見れるよ。\\k全部で７冊有るので\n"
"探してみよう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk005:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk005:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk005:2"
msgid ""
"You're getting closer and \n"
"closer to the boss. \\kYou'll probably have to \n"
"fight after this save!\\e"
msgstr "いよいよボスと対決だ。\\kセーブしてから戦おう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk006:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk006:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk006:2"
msgid ""
"Your Jump height has been \n"
"substantially increased!\\kNow you can reach places you\n"
"couldn't before!\\e"
msgstr ""
"【ジャンプ力】が大幅ＵＰ！\\k今まで届かなかった\n"
"場所にも行けるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk007:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk007:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk008:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk008:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk008:2"
msgid ""
"Those hard guys are \n"
"Gachigachi! \\kIt will take a much hotter\n"
"fire to break them! \\e"
msgstr ""
"硬いコイツは【ガチガチ】\\k火力が低いと\n"
"どうやっても壊せないよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk009:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk009:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk009:2"
msgid ""
"The door appears locked.\\kYou'll need to find a switch\n"
"somewhere.\\e"
msgstr ""
"扉はロックされているみたい。\\k【スイッチ】が何処かに\n"
"有るはずだ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk010:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk010:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk010:2"
msgid ""
"You found Gallery Book #2!\\kAfter clearing the game, go to\n"
"OPTIONS to see the extra art! \\kThere's 7 volumes in all! \n"
"Keep on searching!\\e"
msgstr ""
"【ギャラリー本２】を発見！\\kゲームクリア後に\n"
"ＯＰＴＩＯＮ画面で\n"
"おまけ画像が見れるよ。\\k全部で７冊有るので\n"
"探してみよう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk011:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk011:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk011:2"
msgid ""
"Those blue guys are Poyopoyo. \\kYou can bounce on top of\n"
"them to reach new places. \\e"
msgstr ""
"青いコイツは【ポヨポヨ】。\\k上から乗れば\n"
"高くジャンプ出来るよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk012:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk012:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk012:2"
msgid ""
"Those blue guys are Poyopoyo. \\kYou can bounce on top of\n"
"them to reach new places. \\kHold {LEFT} or {RIGHT} while\n"
"jumping onto them to bounce \n"
"that way. \\e"
msgstr ""
"青いコイツは【ポヨポヨ】。\\k上から乗れば\n"
"高くジャンプ出来るよ。\\k乗った瞬間に\n"
"【{LEFT}か{RIGHT}キー】を押せば\n"
"好きな方向に進めるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk013:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk013:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk013:2"
msgid ""
"Your Fire has increased!\\kNow you can break the hard\n"
"enemies and shoot two fires \n"
"at once!\\e"
msgstr ""
"【火力】が大幅ＵＰ！\\k二連射まで撃てるし\n"
"硬い敵も倒せるかも。\\e"

msgctxt "tk014:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk014:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk014:2"
msgid ""
"Burn the lamps with your\n"
"fire to light them. \\kSomething may happen if \n"
"do... \\e"
msgstr ""
"【燭台】にファイアを当てれば\n"
"火を灯す事が出来るよ。\\k全部点けると…\\e"

msgctxt "tk015:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk015:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk016:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk016:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk016:2"
msgid ""
"On top of this cliff there\n"
"are two \"Golden Mana Stones.\" \\kBut you probably can't get\n"
"up there yet... \\e"
msgstr ""
"この崖の頂上には\n"
"【黄金のマナストーン】が\n"
"ふたつ置いて有るよ。\\kでも今はまだ取れないかも。\\e"

msgctxt "tk016:3"
msgid ""
"Ability Review #1:\\kIf you press {LEFT} or {RIGHT}\n"
"twice you can Dash. \\kAbility Review #2:\\kWith your Fire+ ability, two\n"
"fireballs may be shot at once.\\e"
msgstr ""
"能力のおさらい【その１】\\k【{LEFT}か{RIGHT}キー】を\n"
"２回押すと【ダッシュ】出来るよ。\\k能力のおさらい【その２】\\k【{FIRE}キー】で\n"
"火の玉を二個撃てるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk016:4"
msgid ""
"You found Gallery Book #3!\\kAfter clearing the game, go to\n"
"OPTIONS to see the extra art! \\kThere's 7 volumes in all! \n"
"Keep on searching!\\e"
msgstr ""
"【ギャラリー本３】を発見！\\kゲームクリア後に\n"
"ＯＰＴＩＯＮ画面で\n"
"おまけ画像が見れるよ。\\k全部で７冊有るので\n"
"探してみよう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk017:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk017:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk017:2"
msgid "LOOK UP!\\e"
msgstr "頭上注意！\\e"

msgctxt "tk018:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk018:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk019:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk019:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk019:2"
msgid ""
"Falling in the water means\n"
"a GAME OVER!\\kBe VERY careful if you cross! \\e"
msgstr "水に落ちると即ゲームオーバー！\\k慎重に進んで行こう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk020:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk020:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk020:2"
msgid ""
"To open the door you must \n"
"push all the switches.\\e"
msgstr ""
"全部のスイッチを押せば\n"
"扉は開くよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk021:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk021:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk022:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk022:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk022:2"
msgid ""
"You can jump higher if you\n"
"kick off the wall.\\kWhile jumping, jump again as\n"
"soon as you touch the wall. \\kIt can be done with precise \n"
"timing. \\e"
msgstr ""
"壁を蹴ってさらに高く\n"
"ジャンプ出来るよ。\\kジャンプ中に壁を触って\n"
"{JUMP}キー押すだけ。\\k何回でも出来るよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk023:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk023:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk023:2"
msgid ""
"Ahead of this room is the \n"
"boss! \\kBe sure to taunt him on your\n"
"way in with something like\n"
"\"Bring it on, clown!\" \\k(This shameless Art of\n"
"Fighting quote was added by \n"
"the translator) \\e"
msgstr "この先はボスの部屋。\\k気合入れてイコー！\\e"

msgctxt "tk024:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk024:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk025:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk025:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

