msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk027:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk028:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk028:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk028:2"
msgid ""
"Some enemies are mimics...\\kYou should approach slowly\n"
"until you notice a difference.\\e"
msgstr "ニセモノがひとつ…\\kよく見れば違いが分かるはずだ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk029:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk029:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk030:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk030:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk031:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk031:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk031:2"
msgid ""
"The correct answer is \"XXO.\"\\kJust try to think about it\n"
"for a little bit. \\e"
msgstr "正解は「××○」だよ。\\kちょっと考えてみよう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk032:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk032:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk032:2"
msgid ""
"This gate can be passed by\n"
"turning into a cloud. \\kOnce you have the Cloud \n"
"power, press {DOWN} while \n"
"jumping.\\kPressing {DOWN} will transform\n"
"you into a cloud. \\e"
msgstr ""
"この柵は【クラウド】で\n"
"通り抜けられるよ。\\k手に入れたら\n"
"ジャンプ中に【{DOWN}キー】を\n"
"押して変身だ。\\k【{DOWN}キー】を押しながら\n"
"【{JUMP}キー】でも\n"
"変身出来るよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk033:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk033:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk034:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk034:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk035:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk035:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk036:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk036:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk036:2"
msgid ""
"Now you can change into an\n"
"invincible cloud. \\kWhile jumping, press {DOWN} to\n"
"transform.\\kBy transforming you can \n"
"explore some areas you\n"
"previously couldn't.\\e"
msgstr ""
"完全無敵の【クラウド】に\n"
"変身出来るよ。\\kジャンプ中に【{DOWN}キー】を\n"
"押して変身だ。\\k変身が解けた後に\n"
"隙が出来るのでご注意を。\\e"

msgctxt "tk037:0"
msgid "Will you save the game? \\w"
msgstr "セーブしますか？\\w"

msgctxt "tk037:1"
msgid "Saving completed! \\e"
msgstr "セーブ完了しました。\\e"

msgctxt "tk037:2"
msgid ""
"Defeating all the trembling \n"
"Henahena will open the door.\\kHowever, they can't be beaten \n"
"with fire...\\e"
msgstr ""
"震えているのは【ヘナヘナ】\\k全滅させれば\n"
"扉は開くよ。\\kファイアでは倒せないけど…\\e"

