msgctxt "tk040:2"
msgid ""
"Ability Review #1 \\kBy pressing {LEFT} or {RIGHT}\n"
"twice, you can Dash. \\e"
msgstr ""
"能力のおさらい【その１】\\k【{LEFT}か{RIGHT}キー】を\n"
"２回押すと【ダッシュ】出来るよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk040:3"
msgid ""
"Ability Review #2 \\kUsing the {FIRE} key, up to\n"
"two fireballs may be shot in\n"
"a row.\\e"
msgstr ""
"能力のおさらい【その２】\\k【{FIRE}キー】で\n"
"火の玉を二個撃てるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk040:4"
msgid ""
"Ability Review #3 \\kYou can kick off the wall to\n"
"jump higher.\\kWhen jumping, jump again as \n"
"soon as you touch the wall. \\kIt can be done with precise \n"
"timing. \\e"
msgstr ""
"能力のおさらい【その３】\\k壁を蹴ってさらに高く\n"
"ジャンプ出来るよ。\\kジャンプ中に壁を触って\n"
"{JUMP}キー押すだけ。\\k何回でも出来るよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk040:5"
msgid ""
"Ability Review #4 \\kYou can turn into an\n"
"invincible cloud. \\kPress {DOWN} while jumping to \n"
"transform.\\kAfter transforming you'll \n"
"return to normal. \\e"
msgstr ""
"能力のおさらい【その４】\\k完全無敵の【クラウド】に\n"
"変身出来るよ。\\kジャンプ中に【{DOWN}キー】を\n"
"押して変身だ。\\k変身が解けた後に\n"
"隙が出来るのでご注意を。\\e"

msgctxt "tk040:6"
msgid ""
"Ability Review #4 Part Deux \\kYou can pass this gate by \n"
"turning into a cloud. \\kPress {DOWN} during a jump to \n"
"transform and shoot through \n"
"the gate. \\e"
msgstr ""
"能力のおさらい【その４・補足】\\kこの柵は【クラウド】で\n"
"通り抜けられるよ。\\k【{DOWN}キー】を押しながら\n"
"【{JUMP}キー】でも\n"
"変身出来るよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk040:7"
msgid ""
"You found Gallery Book #5!\\kAfter clearing the game, go to\n"
"OPTIONS to see the extra art! \\kThere's 7 volumes in all! \n"
"Keep on searching!\\e"
msgstr ""
