msgctxt "tk059:2"
msgid ""
"You can now turn into a bat \n"
"and fly through the air.\\kTo transform, press {UP} while\n"
"jumping.\\kTo fly, just keep pressing\n"
"the {JUMP} key.\\kYou can keep flying till you\n"
"hit a wall. \\e"
msgstr ""
"空を飛べる【バット】に\n"
"変身出来るよ。\\kジャンプ中に【{UP}キー】を\n"
"押して変身だ。\\k{JUMP}キー連打で飛べるよ。\\k壁に当たるまで\n"
"変身していられるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk059:3"
msgid ""
"Hold down the {FIRE} key to\n"
"store up firepower. \\kWhen it becomes MAX, a more \n"
"powerful flame can be shot. \\kA MAX flame can penetrate   \n"
"enemies and crack through \n"
"their defenses. \\e"
msgstr ""
"{FIRE}キーを押し続けて\n"
"火力を溜める事が出来るよ。\\kＭＡＸになったら\n"
"強力な炎を撃てるよ。\\k敵も貫通するし\n"
"堅い敵も壊せるかも。\\e"

