msgid ""
"Defeating the enemies will\n"
"open the door.\\kHowever, you must defeat\n"
"them in a specific order. \\e"
msgstr ""
"敵を全滅させれば\n"
"扉は開くよ。\\kでも、ある順番で\n"
"倒さないとダメだよ。\\e"

