msgctxt "tk062:2"
msgid ""
"The hero's room is just \n"
"ahead.\\kThe time for the final\n"
"confrontation draws near! \\e"
msgstr "この先は「ゆうしゃ」の部屋。\\kいよいよ対決の時だ！\\e"

msgctxt "tk063:0"
msgid ""
"It's time to search for the 9 \n"
"stones the hero sealed! \\e"
msgstr ""
"【ゆうしゃ】に封じられた\n"
"【９つの力】を探しに行こう！\\e"

msgctxt "tk063:1"
msgid ""
"Those things are \"Mana Stones.\" \\kIf you gather enough of them, \n"
"your LIFE will increase!  \\e"
msgstr ""
"あれは【マナストーン】\\k集めれば最大ＬＩＦＥが\n"
"１つ増えるよ。\\e"

msgctxt "tk063:2"
msgid ""
"Press {LEFT} or {RIGHT} twice\n"
"to perform a Dash move.\\kYou should try it right away! \\e"
msgstr ""
"【{LEFT}か{RIGHT}キー】を\n"
"２回押すと【ダッシュ】出来るよ。\\kさっそく使ってみよう。\\e"

msgctxt "tk063:3"
msgid ""
"Those things are \"Mana Stones.\" \\kBut it seems they're already  \n"
"gone... \\e"
msgstr "あれは【マナストーン】\\kてか、もう無いけど…\\e"

